rward but not a reason to distrust the underlying finding. As phase 1/3 this is a pure verification/documentation finding (explicitly 'R&D THUẦN, CHƯA sửa động [REDACTED] nào'), and the later phase-2/3 regression confirms zero real orders were ever affected, which further lowers the stakes of any residual uncertainty."}
