: "Dung di tim 'nguon gia dung' — hay cuong che 'MOT he quy chieu duy nhat'. Sai khong nam o nguon nao xau, ma o cho hai so trong cung mot phep tinh den tu hai phien khac nhau.", "D1": "resolve_reference(ticker, session_date) — tai dung THANG check_reference_snapshot() + official_reference_price() da build o job truoc. Giu nguyen 3 cong G1/G2/G3.", "G4_MOI": "Bat bien DONG-HE: voi ma co ex_date thuoc {hom nay, phien ke tiep}, MOI lo cua cung mot ma trong CUNG ban doc positions phai co CUNG marketPrice. Khac nhau => fail-closed, khong sinh lenh cho ma do. Day la cong DUY NHAT bat duoc ca 19:10:23 — G1/G2/G3 deu mu vi moi lo rieng le deu tu nhat quan.", "G5_MOI": "Doi soat q.ref voi cong thuc so giao dich dung lai tu corporate_action: (P_cum - tien_mat + r x gia_phat_hanh)/(1+r), lam tron buoc gia. Khop TUYET DOI 2/2 ca doc lap: MBB 08-11 (24.250+0,1x10.000)/1,25 = 20.200 = dung anh chup app DNSE cua user; SSI 08-17 (24.500-1.000)/1,2 = 19.583 -> tick -> 19.600 = dung q.ref do o job truoc.", "D2": "MOT cong o tang SINH PLAN (khong rai khap noi): ma co exright_date == plan_date => ref_price BAT BUOC tu q.ref (cam moi nguon lich su), qty va hard_no_chase_ceiling_vnd tinh LAI tren chinh gia do, moi anchor lich su quy doi ve he moi hoac BO ma do khoi plan. Khong xac dinh duoc => KHONG sinh lenh, ghi ly do vao notes[].", "D3": "Dong 3 cho cu the: strategies.py:_price() chan fallback HIST khi ex_today; merge_park_orders.py lech L1/L2 + ma co su kien => CHAN ma do thay vi 'lay gia thap hon'; paper_main_probe_plan.py sua de evidence R&D khong nhiem.", "D4_KHONG_lam": "KHONG doi gio cron. Xem muc THOI_DIEM_LAT_KHONG_ON_DINH.", "D5_KHONG_lam": "KHONG tu tinh lai gia tham chieu de thay q.ref (cong thuc chi dung DOI SOAT, dung vai nhu job truoc da chot). KHONG dung nen backtest pt_v23. KHONG mo rong data/corp_actions.json.", "tham_so_con_thieu": "corporate_action co exercise_ratio nhung KHONG co gia phat hanh quyen mua (MBB 10.000d phai nhap tay). Ban va that can nguon cho tham so nay hoac fail-closed khi thieu."}, "buoc_ke_tiep": "Cho Mike/user xem thiet ke roi code hoa D1-D3 o luot dispatch sau, kem selfcheck co CA CHUNG MINH NGUOC (dung lai ban doc 19:10:23 cua BID va yeu cau G4 chan; dung lai plan_main_[REDACTED] va yeu cau cong bat 24.250) + hoi quy '0 lenh doi gia tri o ngay KHONG co su kien'."}
