ced ⇒ reader cu tra RONG dung ngay cong can chay. Do that tren BQ song: events(executed_only=True)=0 dong vs pricing_events()=5 dong (BID/MBS/SSI 08-17, VIX 08-20)"}, "D2_cong_mot_cho": {"file": "trading_bot/exdate_gate.py (moi), wire bot_execute.py sau connect() truoc funding gate", "vi_sao_mot_cong": "README §1 liet ke 12 duong gia (A-L); va tung cho la moi cai thu 13 (§28 coding_guidelines). Dat o cho HEP NHAT moi plan live phai qua — cung vi tri/ly le voi filter_lag_rating_orders", "quyet_dinh_hien_thuc": ["MUA giu GIA TRI tinh lai SO LUONG (qty la dai luong dan xuat; gia tri moi la y dinh sizing)", "BAN vao su kien doi SO LUONG ⇒ BO, khong doan (khong suy duoc y dinh goc tu 1 con so qty — dung co che 'ban ao' §2). Co tuc TIEN MAT khong doi so luong ⇒ giu qty, chi lam tuoi ref_price", "Tra lich hong ⇒ FAIL-OPEN + bao TO (nguon lich la BQ, he THU BA ngoai duong dat lenh; cho no quyen dung ca phien la doi rui ro hiem lay rui ro thuong). Luoi con lai: check_ref_vs_live() dung sai 1% < moi cu lat do duoc (min 0,8%). RUI RO TON DU CO CONG BO", "Gia phat hanh quyen mua: so tay RIGHTS_ISSUE_PRICE, thieu ⇒ FAIL-CLOSED (bang vendor de value_per_share NULL cho MOI dong ISS, kiem 14 su kien that)"]}, "D3_ba_cho": {"1_strategies._price": "chan CA HAI fallback lich su (recs_close + gia giao dich paper) khi ex_today", "2_merge_park_orders": "lech L1/L2 >1% VA ma co su kien trong cua so ⇒ CHAN RIENG ma do (khong dung ca plan), thay 'lay gia thap hon'. Ngoai cua so: hanh vi cu NGUYEN VEN. Nguong 1% = nho nhat trong 22 ngay-ma do duoc la 0,8%, trung RULE_A_REF_TOL_DEFAULT", "3_paper_main_probe_plan": "loai ma GDKHQ — evidence R&D dang nhiem THAT (plan_main 08-11 ref 24.250 vs 20.200 dung, +20,0%, created_at 08:52 SANG dung ngay GDKHQ). 3 chuong trinh paper doc chinh nhung lenh nay", "them_§6.1_lag_entry_anchor": "loai cap vat qua GDKHQ + DINH CHINH docstring: cau 'Price khong hoi to nen mien nhiem' DUNG MOT NUA (mien nhiem hoi to, KHONG mien nhiem lech he quy chieu). Anchor la TRAN ⇒ he CU CAO hon ⇒ tran NOI RA chu khong siet (SSI −20,1% noi tran +25% = tran tat, im lang)"}, "defect_tu_tim_ra_khi_review_lai": "merge_park_orders._has_event_in_window() import trading_bot.price_frame ma

